[I] Texture mapping system by Walt Disney Animation Studios

[T] Ptex is a texture mapping system developed by Walt Disney Animation
[T] Studios for production-quality rendering. It applies a separate texture
[T] to each face of a mesh without UV assignment and stores them efficiently
[T] in a single file.

[U] https://ptex.us/

[A] Ptex Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

